&lt;p&gt;Coding ability&lt;br&gt;
Project experience&lt;br&gt;
Consistency&lt;br&gt;
Problem-solving skills&lt;br&gt;
Unlike a resume, GitHub shows real work.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3.2 Portfolio of Projects&lt;br&gt;
Instead of writing “I know Python” or “I know JavaScript,” developers can show:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Real applications&lt;br&gt;
Websites&lt;br&gt;
Scripts&lt;br&gt;
APIs&lt;br&gt;
Tools&lt;br&gt;
